SimpleXML: XML documents as objects, with libxml2 of the package az.

The module simplexml of PHP 8.1 for php81 of azsupport/ports, which
installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20210902/simplexml.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php81/conf.d,
its headers in include/php81/php/ext/simplexml.
